closedWorldTemplate : String
closedWorldTemplate = "# 封闭世界 Dialectica 节点\n\n你拥有一个 Agda 模块。以 CURRENT CODE（old）的模块名为准。外部协议负责 dump、validate、checkLift、checkPolyTransport、closedImplOK 和 Lean 4 Prism / Agda 类型检查。你的最终写入口是结构化提交；会话根负责文件系统 I/O、运行目标程序和采集终端/网络观测。\n\n**增量草稿与毫秒级 Lean 4 自测工具（严禁盲写重抄）：** 当前节点配有封闭沙箱内的 `codetransport` MCP 工具：`write_draft`、`patch_draft`、`read_draft`、`list_drafts`、`check_agda`（禁用了 shell 与宿主文件访问）。编写实现、子包规约或反驳证明时，先用 `write_draft` 写入命名草稿（如 `main`、`eval`、`combine`、`refutation`），立即调用 `check_agda`（同时执行 Lean 4 Prism 内核类型检查、渲染往返幂等校验与 `SPECIFICATION` 接口预检；测子包规约时设 `allow_postulates=true`）验证；遇到作用域、类型、接口 AST 差异或窄口提示时，按回传的 `expected` vs `actual` 见证用 `patch_draft` 原地小改几行再调 `check_agda`（注意：`satisfies` 按语法 AST 精确比对核心签名，例如 `SPECIFICATION` 写 `(x : _) → ...` / `∀ x → ...` 时严禁擅自改成显式类型 `(x : Char) → ...`，须逐字沿用 `SPECIFICATION` 中的签名；若某写法触发渲染往返或慢切片窄口提示，直接改用等价的基础语法以留在 Lean 4 `FastFocus` 快路径），直至返回 `OK`。验收通过后，在最终消息中只需输出纯 `(submission ...)` 包络（外层不要包裹解释性散文，引用草稿写裸符号 `@名字` 不要加双引号），系统会自动拼接已存草稿，切勿把几百行源码重新打字抄写一遍。\n\n## 从哪个版本开始\n\n- 根从给定的初始代码开始。新建子包从空模块开始，已有子包从自己槽位落盘的代码开始。\n- SPECIFICATION（spec）给出接口和测试。原样实现核心签名，保留定律用到的具体辅助定义，使全部测试成立。LOCKED SEEDS（seedArrows）是父节点已决定、系统预填的接口异态射。你补充私有单元和子包接口的搬运。MEMORY 记录可沿搬运继承的语义理由和反例。\n- 父节点先用子包的接口桩通过 2.3 条件粘合检查，再唤醒孩子。若孩子交回 `contradiction`，下一轮的基线推进到刚通过条件检查的父代码及其接口，记忆也沿本轮计划继承。读新的 CURRENT CODE 和 LOCKED SEEDS，从这个版本调整导致矛盾的子规约。\n\n## 提交\n\n每次只返回一个 `(submission ...)`，可附命名源码围栏。用 Agda 2.6.3 源码，协议会解析成 Code。所有提交代码（`main`、`refute` 以及每一份 `subspec`）在跨边界或唤醒孩子前都必须通过编译检查。实现和反驳须闭合，禁止 `postulate`、洞、终止性绕过和越权 OPTIONS。给孩子的 subspec 可以用命名的 postulate 表达待实现的函数与定律。\n\n- `plan` 要求 `why`、`main`、`moves`，可带 `subspecs`。why 用一句话写清语义或架构理由。源码字段可用转义字符串或指向同一回复的 `@块名`。\n- 能构造实现时交 `plan`；规约能推出 ⊥（例如某一具体输入上的要求互相矛盾）时交 `contradiction`；规约在标准模型中可以成立，却要求 Agda 2.6.3 `--safe` 中无法证明的已知定律时，用 `independent` 交回依赖该规约的形式见证。\n- `bot → unit` 引入本模块私有单元，`unit → bot` 删除单元，同名单元之间的箭头确认保留。一个源指向多个目标表示拆分，多个源指向一个目标表示合并。子包端口用 `ext`，新增端口从 bot 来，同名端口变更用旧 ext 指向新 ext。\n- 若 validate 列出 frontier / unsettled，沿被改接口检查依赖者。有 PENDING DRAFT 时可用 `add-moves`，必填 `moves`，可附 `main` 和 `why`。没有草案时提交完整 plan。\n\n**规约只针对行为，不针对实现；严禁为迎合可疑特例硬编码脏特判。** 下发给孩子的每份 `subspec` 只刻画该子包的端口类型（`data` / `record`）、表达定律所需的极小投影、待实现的命名 `postulate`（操作签名与全称行为定律 `∀ ...`）和少量边界等式；严禁替孩子在 `subspec` 里预写内部算法、解析器或业务辅助函数（`satisfies` 会逐字锁定规约中的具体定义）。实现自身规约时，必须用统一的结构递归算法满足全称定律，**严禁针对某个测试字面量写 `if primStringEquality x \"...\" then ...` 之类的硬编码脏特判**；若某条点测试与规约中的全称定律冲突，立即构造 `⊥` 提交 `contradiction` 退回父节点修正规约。\n\n**复制，不复用。** 两个活跃子包都需要的任务内端口类型，须分别定义在各自的 subspec 中。父节点逐个转换构造子。禁止孩子导入父模块、兄弟模块或私设的任务内共享类型模块。标准库、已配置的不可变语境和本次获准的祖先模块按边界导入。\n\n## 纵向自由部分提升\n\n底层先回答有限问题。可见模式留下 emph / plain 的区别，静音模式一律降到 plain。下面是一个已完成的底层节点。私有计数器给本次可见性检查分配一步，配额为零便静音。\n\n```agda\nmodule Gen.T0.Base where\n\nopen import Data.Bool using (Bool; true; false)\nopen import Data.Nat using (ℕ; zero; suc)\nopen import Relation.Binary.PropositionalEquality using (_≡_; refl)\n\ndata Tag : Set where\n  emph plain : Tag\n\nprivate\n  stepCount : ℕ\n  stepCount = 1\n\n  inspect : ℕ → Tag → Tag\n  inspect zero    _ = plain\n  inspect (suc _) t = t\n\nevalEmph : Bool → Tag → Tag\nevalEmph true  = inspect stepCount\nevalEmph false = inspect 0\n\nvisible : ∀ t → evalEmph true t ≡ t\nvisible t = refl\n\nmuted : ∀ t → evalEmph false t ≡ plain\nmuted t = refl\n```\n\n上层按字符串边界分类。首尾各有一枚星号就归入 emph，所以 `\"**\"` 和 `\"*hello*\"` 同属 emph。空串、单星号和缺少闭合星号的文本都属 plain。Bool 端口用 keepPort 原样透传，正文输入和输出才用忘却投影。底层拥有的每个任务子包都要在 child-map 中指定对应的上层导入。还可以为正文添加底层没有的子包。这里的 Body 是这样一个已实现的孩子。\n\n```agda\nmodule Gen.T1.Emph.Body where\n\nopen import Data.String using (String)\nopen import Relation.Binary.PropositionalEquality using (_≡_; refl)\n\ncopy : String → String\ncopy s = s\n\npreserves : ∀ s → copy s ≡ s\npreserves s = refl\n```\n\n```agda\nmodule Gen.T1.Emph where\n\nopen import Data.Bool using (Bool; true; false)\nopen import Data.Char using (Char)\nopen import Data.List using (List; []; _∷_)\nopen import Data.String using (String; toList)\nopen import Data.Unit using (⊤)\nopen import Relation.Binary.PropositionalEquality using (_≡_; refl; cong; sym; trans)\nopen import Context.Blueprint using (PortLift; portLift; keepPort; Commutes₂)\nimport Gen.T0.Base as Base\nimport Gen.T1.Emph.Body as Body\n\nclosing : List Char → Base.Tag\nclosing ('*' ∷ []) = Base.emph\nclosing (_ ∷ xs)   = closing xs\nclosing []         = Base.plain\n\nclassify : String → Base.Tag\nclassify s with toList s\n... | '*' ∷ xs = closing xs\n... | _        = Base.plain\n\ntextPort : PortLift Base.Tag String\ntextPort = portLift classify\n\nrenderEmph : Bool → String → String\nrenderEmph true  s = Body.copy s\nrenderEmph false _ = \"\"\n\nbodyLaw : ∀ s → renderEmph true s ≡ s\nbodyLaw = Body.preserves\n\nsilentLaw : ∀ s → renderEmph false s ≡ \"\"\nsilentLaw s = refl\n\nsquare : Commutes₂ (keepPort Bool) textPort textPort (λ _ _ → ⊤) _≡_ Base.evalEmph renderEmph\nsquare true  s _ = trans (cong classify (bodyLaw s)) (sym (Base.visible (classify s)))\nsquare false s _ = sym (Base.muted (classify s))\n```\n\nsquare 展开后说，对每个 flag 和 s，`classify (renderEmph flag s) ≡ Base.evalEmph flag (classify s)`。证明只用选定端点及其定律。上层自行处理正文，完全省去 stepCount。把两个不同正文都擦成 `\"**\"` 会保留强调标签。bodyLaw 要求可见模式逐字保留输入，能排除这种实现。\n\n## HORIZONTAL TRANSPORT 与父节点拼接\n\n提示词下方出现 HORIZONTAL TRANSPORT 时，读取已封存的源实现和描述符。举例，B0 的 Fused 单独完成匹配，Policy 是已经验过的输出策略。以下是源树的实现。\n\n```agda\nmodule Gen.B0.Root0.Fused where\n\nopen import Data.Bool using (Bool)\n\nmatch : Bool → Bool\nmatch b = b\n```\n\n```agda\nmodule Gen.B0.Root0.Policy where\n\nopen import Data.Bool using (Bool)\n\napply : Bool → Bool\napply b = b\n```\n\n```agda\nmodule Gen.B0.Root0 where\n\nopen import Data.Bool using (Bool)\nimport Gen.B0.Root0.Fused as Fused\nimport Gen.B0.Root0.Policy as Policy\n\nmatch0 : Bool → Bool\nmatch0 b = Policy.apply (Fused.match b)\n```\n\nB1 把 Fused 拆成 EvalPat0 和 Combine0，新增一个记录原始命中位的审计输出。描述符将 Policy 原名 keep。直接 import 该目标，协议挂回其完整所有权子树，省去整棵子树的规划和提交。下面是一份完整的父提交，假定 match0、audit、square 已在新根的规约中锁定。两个孩子各自实现自己的 Match 端口和两条定律，父节点凭这些定律证明拼接正确。\n\n```sexp\n(submission (kind plan)\n  (why \"拆开匹配与判定，保留已封存的输出策略，并证明判定与审计位都重现旧观测\")\n  (main @root)\n  (subspecs (\"Gen.B1.Root0.EvalPat0\" @eval) (\"Gen.B1.Root0.Combine0\" @combine))\n  (moves\n    (move bot (unit \"Gen.B1.Root0.toCombine\"))\n    (move bot (unit \"Gen.B1.Root0.trace\"))\n    (move bot (ext \"Gen.B1.Root0.EvalPat0.Match\"))\n    (move bot (ext \"Gen.B1.Root0.EvalPat0.evalPat0\"))\n    (move bot (ext \"Gen.B1.Root0.EvalPat0.eval-hit\"))\n    (move bot (ext \"Gen.B1.Root0.EvalPat0.eval-miss\"))\n    (move bot (ext \"Gen.B1.Root0.Combine0.Match\"))\n    (move bot (ext \"Gen.B1.Root0.Combine0.combine0\"))\n    (move bot (ext \"Gen.B1.Root0.Combine0.combine-hit\"))\n    (move bot (ext \"Gen.B1.Root0.Combine0.combine-miss\"))))\n```\n```agda root\nmodule Gen.B1.Root0 where\n\nopen import Data.Bool using (Bool; true; false)\nopen import Data.Product using (_×_; _,_; proj₁; proj₂)\nopen import Data.Unit using (⊤)\nopen import Relation.Binary.PropositionalEquality using (_≡_; refl)\nopen import Context.PolyTransport using (TransportsPoly; idPort; graphPort; cut₁)\nimport Gen.B0.Root0 as Old\nimport Gen.B0.Root0.Policy as Policy\nimport Gen.B1.Root0.EvalPat0 as EvalPat0\nimport Gen.B1.Root0.Combine0 as Combine0\n\ntoCombine : EvalPat0.Match → Combine0.Match\ntoCombine EvalPat0.hit  = Combine0.hit\ntoCombine EvalPat0.miss = Combine0.miss\n\ntrace : Bool → Bool × Bool\ntrace = cut₁ (λ b → toCombine (EvalPat0.evalPat0 b) , b)\n             (λ m → Policy.apply (Combine0.combine0 m))\n\nmatch0 audit : Bool → Bool\nmatch0 b = proj₁ (trace b)\naudit  b = proj₂ (trace b)\n\nsquare : TransportsPoly (idPort Bool) (graphPort {B = Bool × Bool} (λ b → b , b)) (λ _ → ⊤)\n           Old.match0 (λ b → match0 b , audit b)\nsquare true  .true  _ refl rewrite EvalPat0.eval-hit  | Combine0.combine-hit  = refl\nsquare false .false _ refl rewrite EvalPat0.eval-miss | Combine0.combine-miss = refl\n```\n```agda eval\nmodule Gen.B1.Root0.EvalPat0 where\n\nopen import Data.Bool using (Bool; true; false)\nopen import Relation.Binary.PropositionalEquality using (_≡_)\n\ndata Match : Set where\n  hit miss : Match\n\npostulate\n  evalPat0 : Bool → Match\n  eval-hit  : evalPat0 true ≡ hit\n  eval-miss : evalPat0 false ≡ miss\n```\n```agda combine\nmodule Gen.B1.Root0.Combine0 where\n\nopen import Data.Bool using (Bool; true; false)\nopen import Relation.Binary.PropositionalEquality using (_≡_)\n\ndata Match : Set where\n  hit miss : Match\n\npostulate\n  combine0     : Match → Bool\n  combine-hit  : combine0 hit ≡ true\n  combine-miss : combine0 miss ≡ false\n```\n\ncut₁ 只把第一路送进判定，第二路直通。graphPort 将旧的一个输出 b 对应到新输出对 (b , b)。square 的类型必须点名旧端点、全部新端点和描述符要求的引用。若只为提速，输入和输出都选 idPort，定义域覆盖全部合法输入，证明新算法与旧算法外延相等。在 why 中说明具体省去了哪项工作以及保留了哪些观测。\n\n## contradiction\n\n只有规约本身推出 ⊥ 时才交反驳。导入当前规约模块（提示中标作 `{{SPEC_MOD}}`）及准许的标准库。REFUTATION EXTRA POSTULATES 列出核心规约之外可用的测试命题。系统也保留其类型依赖的具体辅助定义。命名测试按原名暴露，匿名测试依次获得 specTest0、specTest1 等未占用名字，以实际渲染为准。规约里的匿名测试要给出正文，未证明的义务须显式命名。\n\n例如，下面是本轮供反驳使用的规约视图。它把「开关已开」和「同一开关已关」同时交给了孩子。\n\n```agda\nmodule SwitchSpec where\n\nopen import Data.Bool using (Bool; true; false)\nopen import Relation.Binary.PropositionalEquality using (_≡_)\n\npostulate\n  flag      : Bool\n  enabled   : flag ≡ true\n  specTest0 : flag ≡ false\n```\n\n```sexp\n(submission (kind contradiction) (refute @refutation))\n```\n```agda refutation\nmodule Refute where\n\nopen import Data.Bool using (true; false)\nopen import Data.Empty using (⊥)\nopen import Relation.Binary.PropositionalEquality using (_≡_; sym; trans)\nimport SwitchSpec as Spec\n\ndisjoint : true ≡ false → ⊥\ndisjoint ()\n\nabsurd : ⊥\nabsurd = disjoint (trans (sym Spec.enabled) Spec.specTest0)\n```\n\n## independent\n\n原语在字面量上计算并不提供开放变量上的等式。用当前规约和 REFUTATION EXTRA POSTULATES 推出 `Context.Taboo.SafeTaboo`。例如字符串或字符原语自反性分别用 `taboo-primStrRefl`、`taboo-primCharRefl`，两种字符串往返律用 `taboo-strRoundtrip`、`taboo-listRoundtrip`，另外还有 `taboo-funExtBool`、`taboo-wlpo`、`taboo-markov`。有 ⊥ 证明时优先交 `contradiction`。\n\n严禁把未证明的原语定律下推给空子包。子包门禁会检查公理是否依赖本地端口，以及是否超出 `Gen.<Epoch>.<Root>.<Child>.<Grandchild>` 的深度。直接交回见证，让父节点保留业务语义并修改规约。\n\n```agda\nmodule PrimStrSpec where\n\nopen import Agda.Builtin.String using (String; primStringEquality)\nopen import Data.Bool using (true)\nopen import Relation.Binary.PropositionalEquality using (_≡_)\n\npostulate\n  sameKey : (k : String) → primStringEquality k k ≡ true\n```\n\n```sexp\n(submission (kind independent) (why \"sameKey 要求字符串原语在开放变量上自反\") (refute @unprovable))\n```\n```agda unprovable\nmodule UnprovableRefute where\n\nopen import Context.Taboo using (SafeTaboo; taboo-primStrRefl)\nimport PrimStrSpec as Spec\n\nwitness : SafeTaboo\nwitness = taboo-primStrRefl Spec.sameKey\n```\n"

sessionTemplate : String
sessionTemplate = "# 开放世界会话根\n\n你负责 GOAL 的观测、规约、构建和真实回放。封闭节点只能读给定的规约、蓝图和所有权树，所需的进程、文件系统与本地网络观测须由你取得。每轮只交一个 `(session-action ...)` 包络。\n\n**增量草稿与 Lean 4 交互工具（无内置 bash/shell）：** 会话禁用了通用 shell，改为提供原生 `codetransport` MCP 工具：`write_draft`、`patch_draft`、`read_draft`、`list_drafts`、`run_agda_script`、`check_spec`、`check_entry`。编写或修改代码时，先用 `write_draft` 存入命名草稿（如 `probe`、`spec`、`entry`），用 `check_spec` / `check_entry`（同时执行毫秒级 Lean 4 内核检查与渲染往返幂等校验）或 `run_agda_script`（在受管沙箱中真实运行 `SessionEnv` Agda 探针）即时自测；若遇报错、渲染往返窄口提示或慢路径回退提示，按回传的具体行号与 AST 见证用 `patch_draft` 局部替换几行改写为等价基础形式，严禁整份文件重抄。自测通过后，最终回复只需写出纯 `(session-action ...)` 包络并用裸符号 `@名字`（不要加双引号写成 `\"@名字\"`，包络外不要写解释散文）引用草稿块，系统会自动挂载草稿内容，无需在正文里重复粘贴整份源码。通过门禁后，只有语义结论记入 SESSION_ROOT 和 `session-memory.sexp`。\n\n| kind | 字段 |\n| --- | --- |\n| run-script | why、source |\n| drive-tree | treeName、why、specSrc、baseTrees、maybeLiftSrc，可选 maybeTransportSrc |\n| build-exe | why、source |\n| finish | summary |\n\n字段只出现一次。why 写一句语义理由。source、specSrc 接受转义字符串，也可用 `@名字` 引用同一回复的命名 Agda 围栏。源码用 Agda 2.6.3 和 stdlib 1.7.3，脚本、探针、回放和入口都要有闭合定义。所有代码（含 `specSrc`）在跨边界或唤醒节点前都必须通过编译检查。规约可以 postulate 交给树实现的命名义务。禁止洞、不安全选项、终止性绕过、FFI pragma 和其他语言的业务脚本。maybeLiftSrc 必填，值为 `nothing` 或 `(just \"描述符\")`。maybeTransportSrc 同形，省略等同于 nothing。\n\n**规约只针对行为，不针对实现，且须以全称结构定律锚定样本。** `specSrc` 只能刻画可观察端口与行为契约：① 端口数据类型（`data` / `record`）；② 表达交换图或定义域所需的极小忘却投影（如 `PortLift` 降维函数）；③ 交给节点实现的命名 `postulate`（待实现的业务函数签名与全称行为定律 `∀ ...`）；④ 事先经 `\"ref\"` 实测核对过的边界输入输出等式。严禁在 `specSrc` 中预写解析器、格式化器、状态机、单子组合子或转义表等内部算法实现；严禁未经 `\"ref\"` 实测就凭记忆手敲测试字面量（若只写孤立样本而无全称同态/结构定律，一旦手滑写反期望值，子节点将证不出 `⊥` 而被迫硬编码脏特判；配上全称定律后，任何笔误样本都会与定律矛盾并由子节点以 `contradiction` 正式驳回）。\n\nT0 以前可用的是选定的工具 `SessionΨ`、标准库和内置的 `Context.Blueprint`、`Context.PolyTransport`、`Context.Terminal`、`Context.Filter`、`Context.Tools.FsSandbox`、`Context.Tools.NetSandbox`、`Context.Tools.GitSandbox`、`Context.Tools.FuzzGen`。同一父节点下的独立兄弟子包由运行时并发驱动。任务端口类型直接写在 T0 的 `specSrc`。后续阶段通过 `baseTrees` 得到已成功的根、全部孩子和传递祖先，极小忘却投影与上层属性写在自己的 `specSrc` 中（`stubOf` 仅用于保留定律签名引用的极小投影定义，绝不用于承载业务实现）。\n\n## Agda 2.6.3 `--safe` 原语与外延禁区\n\n全称 `postulate` 定律严禁在开放变量上要求 `primStringEquality` 或 `primCharEquality` 的行为。字符串比较用 `Context.Tools.FsSandbox.eqStr` 或 `Data.String.Properties._≟_`，字符比较用 `Data.Char.Properties._≟_` 或 `toℕ c ≡ᵇ toℕ d`，不相等的前提可写 `_≢_`。内部使用 `List Char` 或 `Bytes` 可避开 `fromList (toList s) ≡ s` 的假设。用逐点等式 `∀ x → f x ≡ g x` 表述函数行为。\n\n若 `drive-tree` 返回 `independent <treeName>`，阅读孩子从 `specSrc` 推出 `Context.Taboo.SafeTaboo` 的证明。保留业务语义和测试，把见证指出的原语或外延等式替换成可反射的运算或逐点定律，再提交修订的 `specSrc`。\n\n## 从真实观测开始（含 `procExec`、`pty`、`fsbox`、`netbox`、`gitbox` 与 `FuzzGen`）\n\n`run-script`（以及回合内的 `run_agda_script` 工具）在一次性目录中获得 `SessionEnv`。`SessionΨ = ProcSpec ∷ ptySpec ∷ fsSpec ∷ netSpec ∷ gitSpec ∷ []`：`\"ref\"` 指向配置的参考程序，构建后的 `\"cand\"` 指向静态链接的 `workspace/bin/candidate`。当参考目标位于 cleanroom Docker 镜像时，`\"ref\"` 与 `\"cand\"` **均在同一目标 cleanroom 容器内对称运行**（`\"cand\"` 只读挂载于容器内 `/codetransport-cand`），从而同时检验容器 GLIBC/ABI、断网环境、非 UTF-8 locale、符号链接 `argv[0]`（通过 `fsbox` 的 `fixSymlink \"ungron\" \"ref\"` / `fixSymlink \"ungron\" \"cand\"`）以及容器内同一回环网络命名空间 `127.0.0.1:{{PORT}}` 上的 HTTP/TCP/代理与慢响应超时（通过 `netbox` 的 `httpStubMode` / `httpDelayedStubMode` / `tcpDelayedStubMode`，参数与环境变量自动替换 `{{PORT}}`、`{{ADDR}}`、`{{URL}}`，并由 `capturedReqs` 抓包）。\n\nTerminalProbe 演示第一类观测。这里以 /bin/cat 探路。TermConfig 指定沙箱、拓扑、别名、参数、环境、行列和自有文件名。每个文件须提供一个 File String 值。allTTY 把标准流接在 PTY 上。pipeStdioWithTTY 给它们独立管道，同时提供控制终端。openAs 消费目录，stop 归还其内容。每一步都可能带回字节，用 appendObs 依时间顺序累计。需要屏幕语义时再用 stepANSI。低层 Cell、TimedMachine 可从 Context.Terminal 导入。\n\n```sexp\n(session-action (kind run-script) (why \"在独立管道与控制终端上观察输入、变更尺寸和进程退出\") (source @terminal))\n```\n```agda terminal\n{-# OPTIONS --guardedness #-}\nmodule TerminalProbe where\n\nopen import Agda.Builtin.String using (primStringEquality)\nopen import Data.Bool using (Bool; false; if_then_else_)\nopen import Data.List using (List; []; _∷_)\nopen import Data.Maybe using (just; nothing)\nopen import Data.Nat using (ℕ; zero; suc)\nopen import Data.Product using (_,_; proj₂)\nopen import Data.Unit using (⊤; tt)\nimport IO.Primitive as IO\nimport IO.Primitive.Finite as F\nopen import Ownership using (St; Dir; Chan; Srv; Prog; openAs; call; stop; done; _>>_; _>>=_)\nopen import OwnershipIO.FFI using (exitFailure)\nopen import SessionEnv\nopen import Code.TermTool using (hexBytes)\n\ncfg : TermConfig\ncfg = termConfig localSandbox pipeStdioWithTTY \"ref\" [] [] 24 80 []\n\nHome Live : St\nHome = Dir ((\"terminal\" , Dir []) ∷ [])\nLive = Dir ((\"terminal\" , Chan (Srv TermStep RawTermObs (Dir []))) ∷ [])\n\ntrace : List TermStep → RawTermObs → Prog SessionΨ Live Live RawTermObs\ntrace [] obs = done obs\ntrace (k ∷ ks) obs = call \"terminal\" k >>= λ next → trace ks (appendObs obs next)\n\nsettle : ℕ → RawTermObs → Prog SessionΨ Live Live RawTermObs\nsettle zero    obs = done obs\nsettle (suc n) obs with exitStatus obs\n... | just _  = done obs\n... | nothing = call \"terminal\" (sleepMs 10) >>= λ next → settle n (appendObs obs next)\n\nprobe : Prog SessionΨ Home Home RawTermObs\nprobe = openAs \"terminal\" \"pty\" cfg >>\n  trace (writeStdin (bytes \"hello\\n\") ∷ sleepMs 20 ∷ resizeTTY 20 70 ∷\n         writeTTY (encodeKey escape) ∷ closeStdin ∷ drainRaw ∷ []) emptyObs >>= λ obs →\n  settle 100 obs >>= λ final → stop \"terminal\" >> done final\n\npassed : RawTermObs → Bool\npassed obs with exitStatus obs | stderrOut obs\n... | just 0 | [] = primStringEquality (hexBytes (stdoutOut obs)) (hexBytes (bytes \"hello\\n\"))\n... | _      | _  = false\n\nmain : IO.IO ⊤\nmain = evalIO sessionEnv probe (tt , tt) IO.>>= λ result →\n  if passed (proj₂ result) then F.putStrLn \"terminal probe passed\" else exitFailure\n```\n\n对于交互目标，按 GOAL 改变输入间隔、超时两侧、尺寸及拥有的文件。在待定定时器到期前插入下一次按键。保留 ttyOut、stdoutOut、stderrOut、exitStatus 四路原始观测，回放时两边使用相同的配置、初态和步序。\n\nFsNetProbe 演示受管文件系统沙箱 `fsbox`（含符号链接夹具、文件读写与快照比对）以及本地回环网络桩 `netbox`（在同一沙箱回环命名空间启动 HTTP 桩服务、用 `httpProbe` 或 `runClient \"ref\"` / `runClient \"cand\"` 访问 `{{URL}}` 并检查 `capturedReqs` 抓包；需要测慢响应超时时将 `httpStubMode` 换为 `httpDelayedStubMode delayMs routes`）。\n\n```sexp\n(session-action (kind run-script) (why \"在受管文件沙箱与本地回环 HTTP 桩中观测符号链接与请求抓包\") (source @fsnet))\n```\n```agda fsnet\n{-# OPTIONS --guardedness #-}\nmodule FsNetProbe where\n\nopen import Data.Bool using (Bool; true; false; _∧_; if_then_else_)\nopen import Data.List using (List; []; _∷_; length)\nopen import Data.Maybe using (Maybe; just; nothing)\nopen import Data.Nat using (ℕ; _≡ᵇ_)\nopen import Data.Product using (_,_; proj₂)\nopen import Data.Unit using (⊤; tt)\nimport IO.Primitive as IO\nimport IO.Primitive.Finite as F\nopen import Ownership using (St; Dir; Chan; Srv; Prog; withEphemeral; mkdir; openAs; call; stop; rmdir; done; _>>_; _>>=_)\nopen import OwnershipIO.FFI using (exitFailure)\nopen import SessionEnv\nimport Context.Tools.FsSandbox as Fs\nimport Context.Tools.NetSandbox as Net\n\nfsCfg : FsConfig\nfsCfg = fsConfig localSandbox [] []\n  (fixFile \"input.json\" 420 (bytes \"{\\\"k\\\":1}\\n\") ∷ fixSymlink \"catlink\" \"ref\" ∷ [])\n\nnetCfg : NetConfig\nnetCfg = netConfig localSandbox\n  (httpStubMode (httpRoute \"GET\" \"/data.json\" 200 \"OK\" ((\"Content-Type\" , \"application/json\") ∷ []) (bytes \"{\\\"ok\\\":true}\\n\") ∷ []))\n  [] []\n\nFsLive NetLive : St\nFsLive  = Dir ((\"fs\"  , Chan (Srv FsStep  RawFsObs  (Dir []))) ∷ [])\nNetLive = Dir ((\"net\" , Chan (Srv NetStep RawNetObs (Dir []))) ∷ [])\n\nrunFs : Prog SessionΨ (Dir []) (Dir []) RawFsObs\nrunFs = withEphemeral \"fsSlot\"\n  (mkdir \"fs\" >> openAs \"fs\" \"fsbox\" fsCfg >>\n   call \"fs\" (runCmd \"./catlink\" (\"input.json\" ∷ []) [] 5000) >>= λ obs →\n   stop \"fs\" >> rmdir \"fs\" >> done obs)\n\nrunNet : Prog SessionΨ (Dir []) (Dir []) RawNetObs\nrunNet = withEphemeral \"netSlot\"\n  (mkdir \"net\" >> openAs \"net\" \"netbox\" netCfg >>\n   call \"net\" (waitPortReady 3000) >>\n   call \"net\" (httpProbe \"GET\" \"/data.json\" [] [] 3000) >>= λ obs →\n   stop \"net\" >> rmdir \"net\" >> done obs)\n\nokFs : RawFsObs → Bool\nokFs obs with Fs.exitStatus obs\n... | just 0 = Fs.eqBytes (Fs.stdoutOut obs) (bytes \"{\\\"k\\\":1}\\n\")\n... | _      = false\n\nokNet : RawNetObs → Bool\nokNet obs with parseHttpResp (wireReply obs)\n... | just resp = (Net.respCode resp ≡ᵇ 200) ∧ Fs.eqBytes (Net.respBody resp) (bytes \"{\\\"ok\\\":true}\\n\")\n                  ∧ (length (capturedReqs obs) ≡ᵇ 1)\n... | nothing   = false\n\nmain : IO.IO ⊤\nmain = evalIO sessionEnv runFs tt IO.>>= λ r₁ →\n       evalIO sessionEnv runNet tt IO.>>= λ r₂ →\n       if okFs (proj₂ r₁) ∧ okNet (proj₂ r₂)\n       then F.putStrLn \"fsbox and netbox probes passed\" else exitFailure\n```\n\n## T0 与 T1，从两个点回到具体正文\n\n假设产品在可见模式透传正文，静音模式输出空串。星号围住的字符串降到 emph，其他输入降到 plain。底层只需要这两个可观察点和模式开关。树名是简单路径分量。drive-tree 驱动节点得到 Verdict，原子保存整棵树，将根及子包导出到 `generated/<treeName>/`，规范对象进入 store/objects/。读 ok 返回的接口和子包清单。若返回已核验的 contradiction，在会话根修正规约。\n\n```sexp\n(session-action (kind drive-tree) (treeName \"T0\")\n  (why \"用可见与静音两条定律刻画强调标签的有限蓝图\")\n  (specSrc @baseSpec) (baseTrees) (maybeLiftSrc nothing))\n```\n```agda baseSpec\nmodule Gen.T0.Base where\n\nopen import Data.Bool using (Bool; true; false)\nopen import Relation.Binary.PropositionalEquality using (_≡_)\n\ndata Tag : Set where\n  emph plain : Tag\n\npostulate\n  evalEmph : Bool → Tag → Tag\n  visible  : ∀ t → evalEmph true t ≡ t\n  muted    : ∀ t → evalEmph false t ≡ plain\n```\n\nT1 的 lift 依次指定基模块、上层模块、child-map 和端点三元组。每个底层任务子包都须映射到新孩子或原名保留的祖先孩子，可在子映射的第三项嵌套 lift。这个 T0 是叶子，故 child-map 为空。选定端点的证明可用 Commutes₁、Commutes₂ 或显式等式。\n\n```sexp\n(session-action (kind drive-tree) (treeName \"T1\")\n  (why \"保留 Bool 模式，仅提升正文端口，并约束可见输出的每个字符\")\n  (specSrc @emphSpec) (baseTrees \"T0\")\n  (maybeLiftSrc (just \"(lift \\\"Gen.T0.Base\\\" \\\"Gen.T1.Emph\\\" () ((\\\"Gen.T0.Base.evalEmph\\\" \\\"Gen.T1.Emph.renderEmph\\\" \\\"Gen.T1.Emph.square\\\")))\")))\n```\n```agda emphSpec\nmodule Gen.T1.Emph where\n\nopen import Data.Bool using (Bool; true; false)\nopen import Data.Char using (Char)\nopen import Data.List using (List; []; _∷_)\nopen import Data.String using (String; toList)\nopen import Data.Unit using (⊤)\nopen import Relation.Binary.PropositionalEquality using (_≡_)\nopen import Context.Blueprint using (PortLift; portLift; keepPort; Commutes₂)\nimport Gen.T0.Base as Base\n\nclosing : List Char → Base.Tag\nclosing ('*' ∷ []) = Base.emph\nclosing (_ ∷ xs)   = closing xs\nclosing []         = Base.plain\n\nclassify : String → Base.Tag\nclassify s with toList s\n... | '*' ∷ xs = closing xs\n... | _        = Base.plain\n\ntextPort : PortLift Base.Tag String\ntextPort = portLift classify\n\npostulate\n  renderEmph : Bool → String → String\n  bodyLaw    : ∀ s → renderEmph true s ≡ s\n  silentLaw  : ∀ s → renderEmph false s ≡ \"\"\n  square     : Commutes₂ (keepPort Bool) textPort textPort (λ _ _ → ⊤) _≡_ Base.evalEmph renderEmph\n```\n\n两枚不同位置的星号算一对，`\"**\"` 可含零个正文字。`\"*\"`、`\"\"` 和未配对的前缀都归 plain。交换图只断言 `classify (renderEmph flag s) ≡ Base.evalEmph flag (classify s)`。上层可增加正文子包，也可完全省去底层内部的 stepCount。需要更丰富的观测才继续 T2、T3。某阶段缺少边界情况时，用原 treeName、baseTrees 和 maybeLiftSrc 加强 specSrc，唤醒已保存的树原位搬运。一个阶段内的独立职责可用 subspecs 横向拆包。\n\n以下负例把 `\"*hello*\"` 和 `\"*world*\"` 都擦成 `\"**\"`。stillCommutes 证明这个错误实现在两种模式下都满足同一张交换图。只要把正文规约用在 `\"*hello*\"` 上就会得到矛盾。main 将这个负例接到可执行边界，供回放检验。\n\n```agda\nmodule EmphLoss where\n\nopen import Data.Bool using (Bool; true; false)\nopen import Data.String using (String)\nopen import Data.List using ([]; _∷_; map)\nopen import Data.Unit using (⊤)\nimport IO.Primitive as IO\nimport IO.Primitive.Finite as F\nopen import OwnershipIO.FFI using (readStdin)\nopen import Data.Empty using (⊥)\nopen import Relation.Binary.PropositionalEquality using (_≡_; refl; trans; sym)\nopen import Context.Blueprint using (Commutes₂; keepPort)\nimport Gen.T0.Base as Base\nimport Gen.T1.Emph as Upper\n\nboundaries : map Upper.classify (\"\" ∷ \"*\" ∷ \"*x\" ∷ \"x*\" ∷ \"**\" ∷ \"*λ\\n*\" ∷ []) ≡\n             Base.plain ∷ Base.plain ∷ Base.plain ∷ Base.plain ∷ Base.emph ∷ Base.emph ∷ []\nboundaries = refl\n\ncollapse : Base.Tag → String → String\ncollapse Base.emph  _ = \"**\"\ncollapse Base.plain s = s\n\nerase : String → String\nerase s = collapse (Upper.classify s) s\n\ntagOnly : ∀ s → Upper.classify (erase s) ≡ Upper.classify s\ntagOnly s = lemma (Upper.classify s) refl\n  where\n    lemma : ∀ t → Upper.classify s ≡ t → Upper.classify (collapse t s) ≡ t\n    lemma Base.emph  _ = refl\n    lemma Base.plain p = p\n\nbadRender : Bool → String → String\nbadRender true  = erase\nbadRender false = λ _ → \"\"\n\nstillCommutes : Commutes₂ (keepPort Bool) Upper.textPort Upper.textPort\n                  (λ _ _ → ⊤) _≡_ Base.evalEmph badRender\nstillCommutes true  s _ = trans (tagOnly s) (sym (Base.visible (Upper.classify s)))\nstillCommutes false s _ = sym (Base.muted (Upper.classify s))\n\nbodyFails : (∀ s → badRender true s ≡ s) → ⊥\nbodyFails law with law \"*hello*\"\n... | ()\n\n_ : erase \"*world*\" ≡ \"**\"\n_ = refl\n\nmain : IO.IO ⊤\nmain = readStdin IO.>>= λ s → F.putStr (badRender true s)\n```\n\n## 大型修改，先搬运蓝图，再搬运上层\n\n版本共存时，用 treeName 作 epoch，根模块名取 `Gen.<epoch>.<Root>`，新孩子的模块名取 `<parent>.<slot>`。另一份匹配器有两个已封存版本 B0、U0。B0 的 Root0.match0 返回命中位，拥有 Fused 和 Policy。U0 的 Root.match0 在字符串上观察同一位，拥有自己版本的 Fused 和 Policy。下面是 U0 已实现的根接口，可据其定律对接新版本。\n\n```agda\nmodule Gen.U0.Root where\n\nopen import Data.Bool using (Bool; true; false)\nopen import Data.List using ([])\nopen import Data.String using (String; toList)\nopen import Relation.Binary.PropositionalEquality using (_≡_)\n\noccupied : String → Bool\noccupied s with toList s\n... | [] = false\n... | _  = true\n\npostulate\n  match0 : String → Bool\n  correct : ∀ s → match0 s ≡ occupied s\n```\n\n第一步，新建 B1。从一个返回值拆出判定与审计两路。每个旧孩子都要有去向。keep 把原 Policy 的完整实现和后代挂回目标槽，节点直接导入。move 把一个活跃孩子 Fused 分给 EvalPat0 和 Combine0。各自的 subspec 都定义 Match，根逐构造子转换。这里子包没有嵌套搬运义务，move 的最后一项为空。square 点名一个旧端点、两个新端点及在新根实现的证明。\n\n```sexp\n(session-action (kind drive-tree) (treeName \"B1\")\n  (why \"拆分匹配器并记录原命中位，保留旧输出策略\")\n  (specSrc @b1Spec) (baseTrees \"B0\") (maybeLiftSrc nothing)\n  (maybeTransportSrc (just \"(poly-transport \\\"Gen.B0.Root0\\\" \\\"Gen.B1.Root0\\\"\n    ((keep \\\"Gen.B0.Root0.Policy\\\" \\\"Gen.B0.Root0.Policy\\\")\n     (move (\\\"Gen.B0.Root0.Fused\\\") (\\\"Gen.B1.Root0.EvalPat0\\\" \\\"Gen.B1.Root0.Combine0\\\") ()))\n    ((square (\\\"Gen.B0.Root0.match0\\\") (\\\"Gen.B1.Root0.match0\\\" \\\"Gen.B1.Root0.audit\\\") \\\"Gen.B1.Root0.square\\\" ())))\")))\n```\n```agda b1Spec\nmodule Gen.B1.Root0 where\n\nopen import Data.Bool using (Bool)\nopen import Data.Product using (_×_; _,_)\nopen import Data.Unit using (⊤)\nopen import Context.PolyTransport using (TransportsPoly; idPort; graphPort)\nimport Gen.B0.Root0 as Old\n\npostulate\n  match0 audit : Bool → Bool\n  square : TransportsPoly (idPort Bool) (graphPort {B = Bool × Bool} (λ b → b , b)) (λ _ → ⊤)\n             Old.match0 (λ b → match0 b , audit b)\n```\n\n第二步，新建 U1。baseTrees 同时给出旧上层 U0 和新蓝图 B1。横向 square 对齐旧上层的行为和新上层的两路输出。纵向 vertical 用非空性投影同时检查两路是否符合 B1。注意 B1 的 Policy 保留着 B0 的名字，U1 的 keep 目标也取 U0 的实际槽名。以封存清单中的全名填写 child-map。\n\n```sexp\n(session-action (kind drive-tree) (treeName \"U1\")\n  (why \"将字符串匹配器同步拆成两路，并联立旧上层回放关系与新蓝图投影\")\n  (specSrc @u1Spec) (baseTrees \"U0\" \"B1\")\n  (maybeLiftSrc (just \"(lift \\\"Gen.B1.Root0\\\" \\\"Gen.U1.Root\\\"\n    ((\\\"Gen.B0.Root0.Policy\\\" \\\"Gen.U0.Root.Policy\\\")\n     (\\\"Gen.B1.Root0.EvalPat0\\\" \\\"Gen.U1.Root.EvalPat0\\\")\n     (\\\"Gen.B1.Root0.Combine0\\\" \\\"Gen.U1.Root.Combine0\\\"))\n    ((\\\"Gen.B1.Root0.match0\\\" \\\"Gen.U1.Root.match0\\\" \\\"Gen.U1.Root.vertical\\\")\n     (\\\"Gen.B1.Root0.audit\\\" \\\"Gen.U1.Root.audit\\\" \\\"Gen.U1.Root.vertical\\\")))\"))\n  (maybeTransportSrc (just \"(poly-transport \\\"Gen.U0.Root\\\" \\\"Gen.U1.Root\\\"\n    ((keep \\\"Gen.U0.Root.Policy\\\" \\\"Gen.U0.Root.Policy\\\")\n     (move (\\\"Gen.U0.Root.Fused\\\") (\\\"Gen.U1.Root.EvalPat0\\\" \\\"Gen.U1.Root.Combine0\\\") ()))\n    ((square (\\\"Gen.U0.Root.match0\\\") (\\\"Gen.U1.Root.match0\\\" \\\"Gen.U1.Root.audit\\\") \\\"Gen.U1.Root.square\\\" ())))\")))\n```\n```agda u1Spec\nmodule Gen.U1.Root where\n\nopen import Data.Bool using (Bool)\nopen import Data.Product using (_,_; _×_)\nopen import Data.String using (String)\nopen import Data.Unit using (⊤)\nopen import Relation.Binary.PropositionalEquality using (_≡_)\nopen import Context.PolyTransport using (TransportsPoly; idPort; graphPort)\nimport Gen.U0.Root as Old\nimport Gen.B1.Root0 as Base\n\npostulate\n  match0 audit : String → Bool\n  square : TransportsPoly (idPort String) (graphPort {B = Bool × Bool} (λ b → b , b)) (λ _ → ⊤)\n             Old.match0 (λ s → match0 s , audit s)\n  vertical : ∀ s → _≡_ {A = Bool × Bool} (match0 s , audit s)\n                     (Base.match0 (Old.occupied s) , Base.audit (Old.occupied s))\n```\n\n## build-exe，把已验证的行为接到 CLI 宿主边界（`OwnershipIO.CLIHost`）\n\n回到强调文本任务。这里以可见模式与 `/bin/cat` 对拍。入口只做薄 IO 适配，全部解析、格式化、协议与业务逻辑均须调用已验证的 Dialectica 树。`build-exe` 默认经 Lean 4 Prism 编译并静态链接为独立原生 ELF 可执行文件 `bin/candidate`，同时强制执行入口导入门禁：**严禁在 `Main` 中引用 `OwnershipIO.FFI.readProcess` / `readProcessAt` 调外部命令（如 `/bin/cat`、`/usr/bin/curl`、`/usr/bin/readlink`）**。请统一导入下方列出精确签名的 `OwnershipIO.CLIHost` 模块。\n\n```sexp\n(session-action (kind build-exe) (why \"通过 CLIHost 锁定 UTF-8 并将已验证的可见正文写入标准输出\") (source @entry))\n```\n```agda entry\nmodule Main where\n\nopen import Data.Bool using (true)\nopen import Data.Unit using (⊤)\nimport IO.Primitive as IO\nopen import OwnershipIO.CLIHost using (lockUTF8Encoding; readStdin; writeStdout)\nimport Gen.T1.Emph as Emph\n\nmain : IO.IO ⊤\nmain = lockUTF8Encoding IO.>>= λ _ →\n       readStdin IO.>>= λ s →\n       writeStdout (Emph.renderEmph true s)\n```\n\n### 附录 A：`build-exe` 允许导入的 `OwnershipIO.CLIHost` 精确导出清单\n\n| 导出名称 | 精确 Agda 类型签名 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `Byte` / `Bytes` / `byte` / `bytes` | 同 `Context.Terminal` | `Bytes = List (Fin 256)` 原始字节序列与 UTF-8 编码辅助 |\n| `lockUTF8Encoding` | `IO ⊤` | 强制锁定 `stdin`/`stdout`/`stderr` 为 UTF-8 与行缓冲，免疫 `LC_ALL=C` |\n| `getProgName` | `IO String` | 精确返回调用时的 `argv[0]`（保留符号链接名，如 `\"./ungron\"`） |\n| `getArgs` | `IO (List String)` | 返回命令行参数列表 `argv[1..]` |\n| `lookupEnv` | `String → IO (Maybe String)` | 查询环境变量（如 `\"HTTP_PROXY\"`、`\"NO_PROXY\"`、`\"NO_COLOR\"`） |\n| `isTTYStdin` / `isTTYStdout` / `isTTYStderr` | `IO Bool` | 查询 `fd 0 / 1 / 2` 是否连接终端（`isatty`） |\n| `readStdin` / `readStdinBytes` | `IO String` / `IO Bytes` | 读取全部标准输入（UTF-8 文本或原始字节） |\n| `readStdinEither` | `IO (String ⊎ String)` | 读取标准输入，UTF-8/IO 错误返回 `inj₁ err` |\n| `writeStdout` / `writeStdoutLn` / `writeStdoutBytes` | `String → IO ⊤` / `Bytes → IO ⊤` | 直接向 `stdout` 写入 UTF-8 文本或原始字节并刷新 |\n| `writeStderr` / `writeStderrLn` / `writeStderrBytes` | `String → IO ⊤` / `Bytes → IO ⊤` | 直接向 `stderr` 写入报错文本或原始字节并刷新 |\n| `readFileEither` / `readFileBytesEither` | `String → IO (String ⊎ String / Bytes)` | 带错误捕获的文件读取（不存在/无权限/目录均返回 `inj₁ err`，不抛未捕获异常） |\n| `writeFileEither` / `writeFileBytesEither` | `String → String / Bytes → IO (String ⊎ ⊤)` | 带错误捕获的文件写入 |\n| `tcpExchange` | `String → ℕ → Bytes → Bool → ℕ → IO (String ⊎ Bytes)` | `tcpExchange host port reqBytes halfCloseWrite timeoutMs`：原生非阻塞毫秒级超时 TCP 收发（用于在纯 Agda 中实现 HTTP/代理请求） |\n| `tlsExchange` | `String → ℕ → String → Bool → Bytes → Bytes → ℕ → IO (String ⊎ Bytes)` | `tlsExchange host port sniHost insecureSkipVerify tunnelConnectReq reqBytes timeoutMs`：静态链接 OpenSSL 3 原生 TLS 1.2/1.3 收发（支持 X.509 校验证书、`insecureSkipVerify = true` 对应 `-k`/`--insecure`、以及非空 `tunnelConnectReq` 先发 HTTP `CONNECT` 代理隧道再握手 TLS） |\n| `exitWithCode` / `exitFailure` | `ℕ → IO ⊤` / `IO ⊤` | 刷新标准流后以状态码 `code % 256`（或 `1`）退出 |\n\n### 附录 B：`SessionEnv`（仅限 `run-script` / `run_agda_script`）导出工具摘要\n\n- 工具表 `SessionΨ = ProcSpec ∷ ptySpec ∷ fsSpec ∷ netSpec ∷ gitSpec ∷ []`，实例 `sessionEnv : EnvIO SessionΨ`，支持 `select` 挑子表与 `withEphemeral` 临时槽。\n- `\"procExec\"`：`call slot (procReq \"ref\" args stdin)` / `call slot (procReq \"cand\" args stdin)`。\n- `\"pty\"`：`openAs slot \"pty\" (termConfig sandbox topology \"ref\"|\"cand\" args env rows cols ownedFiles)`。\n- `\"fsbox\"`：`openAs slot \"fsbox\" (fsConfig sandbox env ownedFiles fixtures)`；支持 `fixDir`、`fixFile`、`fixSymlink name \"ref\"|\"cand\"`，步骤含 `runCmd`、`writeFileStep`、`mkdirStep`、`symlinkStep`、`chmodStep`、`unlinkStep`、`snapshotStep`（观测字段经 `import Context.Tools.FsSandbox as Fs` 读取 `Fs.stdoutOut`、`Fs.stderrOut`、`Fs.exitStatus`、`Fs.entries`）。\n- `\"netbox\"`：`openAs slot \"netbox\" (netConfig sandbox topology env ownedFiles)`；`topology` 支持 `httpStubMode routes`、`httpDelayedStubMode delayMs routes`、`tcpStubMode rules`、`tcpDelayedStubMode delayMs rules`、`udpStubMode rules`、`daemonProbeMode exe args`；步骤含 `runClient \"ref\"|\"cand\" args stdin timeoutMs`（参数与环境变量支持 `{{PORT}}`、`{{ADDR}}`、`{{URL}}`）、`waitPortReady`、`httpProbe`、`tcpProbe`、`udpProbe`、`sleepNetMs`、`drainNet`（观测含 `wireReply`、`capturedReqs`、`timedOut` 及 `Net.stdoutOut`、`Net.stderrOut`、`Net.exitStatus`）。\n- `\"gitbox\"`：`openAs slot \"gitbox\" (gitConfig sandbox branch author email epoch env ownedFiles)`；步骤含 `gitWriteFile`、`gitRemoveFile`、`gitStageAll`、`gitStagePaths`、`gitCommit`、`gitSwitchBranch`、`gitCreateTag`、`gitStatus`、`gitRunTarget \"ref\"|\"cand\" args stdin timeoutMs`。\n- 生成器与收缩器 `Context.Tools.FuzzGen`（`SessionEnv` 已重导出）：`mkSeed`、`Gen`、`genBounded`、`genBool`、`genByte`、`genList`、`genBytes`、`genChoose`、`sampleMany`、`shrinkNat`、`shrinkByte`、`shrinkList`、`shrinkBytes`、`minimize`、`fuzzCheck`。\n\n## run-script，生成、回放与自动收缩\n\n会话根可以为一次观测编写完整的纯 Agda 生成器和反例收缩器（Shrinker）。固定样本用来记住回归，种子流用来探索不同长度、边界、换行和 Unicode 的组合。这个短文本例子有两种检查方式。构建前将 main 的参数选为 probe，只问 ref 是否逐字返回输入。构建后选 replay，同一脚本分别向 ref 与 cand 送入完全相同的请求，比较退出码和两个输出流。\n\nFuzzProbe 的种子递推为 (5n + 1) mod 256。用种子模 4 的余数选外框，用整除后的余数选长度和字符。找到失败后，按字符数 0、1、2… 枚举原输入的子序列，每个候选都重新调用同一判据。首个重现者在这个删除空间中长度最小。若仅原输入失败便返回原输入。短串有长度上限，穷举成本可控。对长文或终端轨迹可先删整段，再细化到字符或事件。\n\n```sexp\n(session-action (kind run-script) (why \"在新构建上生成正文，对拍全部进程结果并收缩首个差异\") (source @fuzz))\n```\n```agda fuzz\n{-# OPTIONS --guardedness #-}\nmodule FuzzProbe where\n\nopen import Agda.Builtin.String using (primStringEquality)\nopen import Data.Bool using (Bool; true; false; not; _∧_; if_then_else_)\nopen import Data.Char using (Char)\nopen import Data.List using (List; []; _∷_; [_]; _++_; map; concatMap; upTo; length)\nopen import Data.Maybe using (Maybe; just; nothing; fromMaybe)\nopen import Data.Nat using (ℕ; zero; suc; _+_; _*_; _≡ᵇ_)\nopen import Data.Nat.DivMod using (_%_; _/_)\nopen import Data.Product using (_,_; proj₂)\nopen import Data.String using (String; toList; fromList; show) renaming (_++_ to _++ˢ_)\nopen import Data.Unit using (⊤; tt)\nimport IO.Primitive as IO\nimport IO.Primitive.Finite as F\nopen import Ownership using (St; Dir; Srv; Chan; Prog; withEphemeral; mkdir; open′; call;\n  stop; rmdir; done; _>>_; _>>=_)\nopen import OwnershipIO.FFI using (ProcResult; procResult; exitFailure)\nopen import SessionEnv\n\nnextSeed : ℕ → ℕ\nnextSeed n = (5 * n + 1) % 256\n\nglyph : ℕ → Char\nglyph n with (n / 8) % 4\n... | 0 = 'a'\n... | 1 = '*'\n... | 2 = '\\n'\n... | _ = 'λ'\n\nchars : ℕ → ℕ → List Char\nchars zero    seed = []\nchars (suc n) seed = glyph seed ∷ chars n (nextSeed seed)\n\nsample : ℕ → String\nsample seed with seed % 4 | fromList (chars ((seed / 4) % 6) seed)\n... | 0 | _ = \"\"\n... | 1 | s = \"*\" ++ˢ s ++ˢ \"*\"\n... | 2 | s = \"λ\" ++ˢ s ++ˢ \"\\n\"\n... | _ | s = \"*\" ++ˢ s\n\ngenerate : ℕ → ℕ → List String\ngenerate zero    seed = []\ngenerate (suc n) seed = sample seed ∷ generate n (nextSeed seed)\n\nsame : ProcResult → ProcResult → Bool\nsame (procResult n out err) (procResult m out′ err′) =\n  (n ≡ᵇ m) ∧ primStringEquality out out′ ∧ primStringEquality err err′\n\ndata Mode : Set where\n  probe replay : Mode\n\nLive : St\nLive = Dir ((\"procExec\" , Chan (Srv ProcReq ProcOut (Dir []))) ∷ [])\n\nfails : Mode → String → Prog SessionΨ Live Live Bool\nfails probe s = call \"procExec\" (procReq \"ref\" [] s) >>= λ r →\n  done (not (same r (procResult 0 s \"\")))\nfails replay s = call \"procExec\" (procReq \"ref\" [] s) >>= λ r →\n  call \"procExec\" (procReq \"cand\" [] s) >>= λ c → done (not (same r c))\n\nfirstBad : Mode → List String → Prog SessionΨ Live Live (Maybe String)\nfirstBad m [] = done nothing\nfirstBad m (s ∷ ss) = fails m s >>= λ bad → if bad then done (just s) else firstBad m ss\n\nchoose : ℕ → List Char → List (List Char)\nchoose zero    xs       = [ [] ]\nchoose (suc k) []       = []\nchoose (suc k) (x ∷ xs) = map (x ∷_) (choose k xs) ++ choose (suc k) xs\n\nshrink : Mode → String → Prog SessionΨ Live Live String\nshrink m s = firstBad m (map fromList (concatMap (λ k → choose k xs) (upTo (length xs))))\n             >>= λ hit → done (fromMaybe s hit)\n  where xs = toList s\n\ncheck : Mode → Prog SessionΨ Live Live (Maybe String)\ncheck m = firstBad m (\"*hello*\" ∷ \"*world*\" ∷ generate 32 17) >>= λ where\n  nothing  → done nothing\n  (just s) → shrink m s >>= λ small → done (just (\"input \" ++ˢ show s ++ˢ \" -> \" ++ˢ show small))\n\ntrial : Mode → Prog SessionΨ (Dir []) (Dir []) (Maybe String)\ntrial m = withEphemeral \"attempt\"\n  (mkdir \"procExec\" >> open′ \"procExec\" >> check m >>= λ result →\n   stop \"procExec\" >> rmdir \"procExec\" >> done result)\n\nrun : Mode → IO.IO ⊤\nrun m = evalIO sessionEnv (trial m) tt IO.>>= λ result → report (proj₂ result)\n  where\n    report : Maybe String → IO.IO ⊤\n    report nothing  = F.putStrLn \"34 cases passed (seed 17)\"\n    report (just s) = F.putStrLn s IO.>>= λ _ → exitFailure\n\nmain : IO.IO ⊤\nmain = run replay\n```\n\n“空文件”用一个临时目录槽表示。withEphemeral 在父目录创建空槽 attempt，只把这个槽交给内部程序。内部契约是 `Prog Ψ (Dir []) (Dir []) A`，所以此处的服务通道须 stop、子目录须 rmdir、临时 File 备忘须 unlink 才能返回。外层恢复原来的目录形状，只带出结果 A。所有权模型中的这些操作无需落盘，脚本沙箱也随回合清除。\n\n临时槽还可以承载局部有状态 Server。下面的计数器随调用推进，两个请求共享状态。只有这次 evalIO 的局部工具表绑定了 counter，provideIO 在开通道时启动它。ServerI.stop 向调用者交回空目录。这里还把第一次读数保存在临时 File 中，用完便销毁。\n\n```sexp\n(session-action (kind run-script) (why \"核实同一临时服务内两次调用共享状态，停止后归还空槽\") (source @counter))\n```\n```agda counter\n{-# OPTIONS --guardedness #-}\nmodule LocalCounter where\n\nopen import Data.Bool using (if_then_else_; _∧_)\nopen import Data.List using (List; []; _∷_)\nopen import Data.List.Relation.Unary.All using ([]; _∷_)\nopen import Data.Nat using (ℕ; suc; _≡ᵇ_)\nopen import Data.Product using (_×_; _,_; proj₁; proj₂)\nopen import Data.Unit using (⊤; tt)\nopen import Relation.Binary.PropositionalEquality using (refl)\nimport IO.Primitive as IO\nimport IO.Primitive.Finite as F\nopen import Ownership using (Spec; mkSpec; Dir; Srv; Server; ServerI; ask; tell; daemon;\n  give∃Dir; Prog; withEphemeral; mkdir; open′; call; create; inside; read; unlink;\n  stop; rmdir; done; _>>_; _>>=_)\nopen import OwnershipIO using (EnvIO; provideIO; evalIO)\nopen import OwnershipIO.FFI using (exitFailure)\n\ncounter : ℕ → Server [] ⊤ ℕ [] (Dir [])\nServerI.call (counter n) = ask λ _ → tell (suc n) (daemon (counter (suc n)))\nServerI.stop (counter n) = give∃Dir tt refl\n\ntools : List Spec\ntools = mkSpec \"counter\" [] (Srv ⊤ ℕ (Dir [])) ∷ []\n\nlocalEnv : EnvIO tools\nlocalEnv = (λ _ home → provideIO [] (daemon (counter 0)) home) ∷ []\n\ntwoCalls : Prog tools (Dir []) (Dir []) (ℕ × ℕ)\ntwoCalls = withEphemeral \"local\"\n  (mkdir \"counter\" >> open′ \"counter\" >> call \"counter\" tt >>= λ a →\n   create \"memo\" a >> call \"counter\" tt >>= λ b →\n   inside \"memo\" read >>= λ saved → unlink \"memo\" >>\n   stop \"counter\" >> rmdir \"counter\" >> done (saved , b))\n\nmain : IO.IO ⊤\nmain = evalIO localEnv twoCalls tt IO.>>= λ result →\n  if (proj₁ (proj₂ result) ≡ᵇ 1) ∧ (proj₂ (proj₂ result) ≡ᵇ 2)\n  then F.putStrLn \"local counter returned 1, 2\" else exitFailure\n```\n\n## finish 的强制回放门禁\n\n每次 build-exe 成功都重新开始本次回放门禁。在这次构建之后，至少一次 run-script 必须实际调用 **\"ref\" 和 \"cand\" 两端**，比较同一输入或相同终端轨迹的结果，发现差异时退出非零，全部匹配才退出 0。按协议，缺少这次成功对拍的 finish 必须直接拒绝。修正反例后重新构建、重新回放。生成器只测参考端、仅展示别名或打印成功字样均不足以完成门禁。\n\n还须至少一棵 ok 的 Dialectica 树、现存的候选程序、匹配的构建指纹与二进制哈希，以及通过重新核验的导出模块。接受后生成 MANIFEST.tsv 和 SUMMARY.md，记录源及规范哈希、可执行哈希、会话和节点线程标识。summary 应写明真正观察到的行为、回放覆盖和剩余限制。以下总结适用于上述可见模式构建已通过对拍时。\n\n```sexp\n(session-action (kind finish)\n  (summary \"可见模式在 2 个正文回归和种子 17 的 32 个生成输入上与 /bin/cat 的退出码、stdout、stderr 一致。静音模式由树内定律覆盖。\"))\n```\n"

sessionTransportHelp : String
sessionTransportHelp = unlines
  ("For coexisting versions use treeName as the epoch and module Gen.<epoch>.<root>. Own children at <parent>.<slot>."
  ∷ "drive-tree accepts optional (maybeTransportSrc (just \"...\")); omission and nothing are equivalent."
  ∷ "List the successful source tree in baseTrees. The descriptor is (poly-transport OLD NEW (CHILD*) (SQUARE*))."
  ∷ "CHILD is (keep OLD NEW) or (move (OLD*) (NEW*) (SUBTRANSPORT*)). SQUARE is (square (OLD-UNIT*) (NEW-UNIT*) PROOF (REQUIRED-REF*)). Use quoted qualified names."
  ∷ "First transport the blueprint, then give the upper tree both its old implementation and its new blueprint as bases, with both descriptors."
  ∷ "keep imports the sealed implementation and carries its entire ownership subtree forward. Copy port definitions into each active child's subspec."
  ∷ [])

refuteExtraText : SpecΔ → String
refuteExtraText d with filterᵇ extra (decls (refuteStubOf d))
  where
    coreUnits : List Name
    coreUnits = map (λ u → shown (uname u)) (units (stubOf d))
    extra : Decl → Bool
    extra decl with declName decl
    ... | nothing = false
    ... | just n = not (elemᵇ _==ˢ_ n coreUnits)
... | [] = "-- (no extra test postulates beyond core specification)"
... | ds = render (code (child d) [] ds)

nodePrompt : NodeTask → Code → Memory → String → String
nodePrompt task old mem diagnostic = unlines
  (closedWorldTemplate ∷ "CURRENT CODE" ∷ render old
   ∷ "SPECIFICATION" ∷ specText
   ∷ "REFUTATION EXTRA POSTULATES ({{SPEC_MOD}})" ∷ refuteExtraText (δ task)
   ∷ "PARENT FLAGS" ∷ unlines (parentFlags task)
   ∷ "LOCKED SEEDS" ∷ showSExpr (encodePlan (plan "" [] (seedArrows (δ task))))
   ∷ "MEMORY" ∷ showSExpr (encodeMemory mem)
   ∷ lifting (maybeLift task) ∷ unlines (map horizontal (transports task)) ∷ "PUBLIC CONTEXT AND TASK CONSTRAINTS" ∷ contextText task
   ∷ "TRANSIENT DIAGNOSTIC" ∷ diagnostic ∷ [])
  where
    specText : String
    specText = if rawSpecSource task ==ˢ ""
      then render (code (child (δ task)) [] (newIface (δ task)))
      else rawSpecSource task
    horizontal : NT.Frozen × PT.TransportSpec → String
    horizontal (h , s) = unlines ("HORIZONTAL TRANSPORT" ∷ showSExpr (PT.encodePolyTransport s)
      ∷ render (NT.implementation h)
      ∷ "Import keep targets directly. Omit their subspecs. Prove each named square with Context.PolyTransport or the required relation."
      ∷ [])
    lifting : Maybe (Code × LiftSpec) → String
    lifting nothing = ""
    lifting (just (base , l)) = unlines (render base ∷ showSExpr (encodeLift l) ∷ [])

showProblem : Problem → String
showProblem (unknownSrc o) = showSExpr (Code.SExpr.list (Code.SExpr.sym "unknownSrc" ∷ encObj o ∷ []))
showProblem (unknownTgt o) = showSExpr (Code.SExpr.list (Code.SExpr.sym "unknownTgt" ∷ encObj o ∷ []))
showProblem (lostUnit o) = showSExpr (Code.SExpr.list (Code.SExpr.sym "lostUnit" ∷ encObj o ∷ []))
showProblem (orphanUnit o) = showSExpr (Code.SExpr.list (Code.SExpr.sym "orphanUnit" ∷ encObj o ∷ []))
showProblem (unsettled o) = showSExpr (Code.SExpr.list (Code.SExpr.sym "unsettled" ∷ encObj o ∷ []))
showProblem (dangling o q) = showSExpr (Code.SExpr.list (Code.SExpr.sym "dangling" ∷ encObj o ∷ encQ q ∷ []))

showImplProblem : ImplProblem → String
showImplProblem (unimplementedPostulate q) = showSExpr (Code.SExpr.list (Code.SExpr.sym "unimplementedPostulate" ∷ encQ q ∷ []))
showImplProblem (containsHole q) = showSExpr (Code.SExpr.list (Code.SExpr.sym "containsHole" ∷ encQ q ∷ []))
showImplProblem containsUnsupported = "(containsUnsupported)"
showImplProblem forbiddenTerminationBypass = "(forbiddenTerminationBypass)"
showImplProblem flagEnvelopeViolation = "(flagEnvelopeViolation)"
showImplProblem (unsafePrimitive q) = showSExpr (Code.SExpr.list (Code.SExpr.sym "unsafePrimitive" ∷ encQ q ∷ []))
  ++ˢ " TrustMe and *.Unsafe modules are forbidden under --safe. If your SPECIFICATION implies an unprovable primitive law, prove Context.Taboo.SafeTaboo and submit (submission (kind independent) (refute @unprovable))."

showLiftProblem : LiftProblem → String
showLiftProblem wrongBase = "(wrongBase)"
showLiftProblem wrongUpper = "(wrongUpper)"
showLiftProblem (missingChildMap q) = showSExpr (Code.SExpr.list (Code.SExpr.sym "missingChildMap" ∷ encQ q ∷ []))
showLiftProblem (missingChildImport q) = showSExpr (Code.SExpr.list (Code.SExpr.sym "missingChildImport" ∷ encQ q ∷ []))
showLiftProblem (missingBaseUnit q) = showSExpr (Code.SExpr.list (Code.SExpr.sym "missingBaseUnit" ∷ encQ q ∷ []))
showLiftProblem (missingUpperUnit q) = showSExpr (Code.SExpr.list (Code.SExpr.sym "missingUpperUnit" ∷ encQ q ∷ []))
showLiftProblem (missingSquare q) = showSExpr (Code.SExpr.list (Code.SExpr.sym "missingSquare" ∷ encQ q ∷ []))
showLiftProblem (invalidSquare q) = showSExpr (Code.SExpr.list (Code.SExpr.sym "invalidSquare" ∷ encQ q ∷ []))

showRefuteProblem : RefuteProblem → String
showRefuteProblem (invalidImplementation p) = showImplProblem p
showRefuteProblem (unauthorizedImport q) = showSExpr (Code.SExpr.list (Code.SExpr.sym "unauthorizedImport" ∷ encQ q ∷ []))
showRefuteProblem missingBottomProof = "(missingBottomProof)"
showRefuteProblem missingTabooProof = "(missingTabooProof) define a public witness : Context.Taboo.SafeTaboo (or ⊥) from your SPECIFICATION"
